+        // De-Googled build: no account-level password module.
+        //
+        // Checking saved passwords against Google's breach list needs a Chrome account, which
+        // this build does not offer. All the module could report was that it had been unable to
+        // check, under a "Sign in to Chrome" button leading somewhere that does not exist here.
+        // A page whose job is to say whether the browser is in good shape should not be occupied
+        // by a check that can never run.
+        //
+        // The unified module goes with it, being the same account check with the local list
+        // folded in. Passwords saved on the device keep their own module, and the password
+        // settings elsewhere in Settings are untouched: this removes a report, not a feature.
